# Exception: infra/terraform/bootstrap/ intentionally uses `backend "local"`
# and its state file IS committed to git (see infra/terraform/bootstrap/README.md
# for why this is safe: that config only ever creates the Terraform state S3
# bucket + DynamoDB lock table, never secrets).
!infra/terraform/bootstrap/terraform.tfstate
